    1707076464
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I never thought my life would turn out like this. I thought I had everything figured out—who I was, what I was supposed to do. But then… you happened.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1443371838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1474475101,
   "children": [
    1508408240
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s funny… I don’t feel lost anymore. I used to, but now? Now I just feel… happy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-660857366": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1474475101,
   "children": [
    -1561207888
   ],
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I love the life we’ve built together.",
