    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1707076464": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1311516660,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And suddenly, everything changed. For the better.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1508408240": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1443371838,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And I know things haven’t always been easy. But I wouldn’t trade any of it. Not a single moment.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1561207888": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -660857366,
   "actor": "Anna",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Even the messy parts. Even the things I never expected. As long as it’s with you… I don’t mind where we end up.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
